{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2023-04-03 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE COMPLETES INVESTMENT IN WILSON WOLF MANUFACTURING', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS , APRIL 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMPLETED ITS INVESTMENT IN WILSON WOLF MANUFACTURING. WILSON WOLF ACHIEVED THE TRAILING 12-MONTH EARNINGS BEFORE INTEREST, TAXES, DEPRECIATION, AND AMORTIZATION (EBITDA) TARGET OF $55 MILLION, TRIGGERING BIO-TECHNE'S INITIAL INVESTMENT IN THE COMPANY."}